OL,3,GNEWSAWild swimmers bare all for 2027
OL,4,Acharity calendar
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of women who say wild swimming
OL,7,Fhas changed their lives have come
OL,8,Ftogether to feature in a naked charity
OL,9,Fcalendar which shares their stories.
OL,11,FThe women, from Worcestershire, are all
OL,12,Fmembers of the Broadfields swimming
OL,13,Fgroup and found a connection through
OL,14,Fbereavement or experience with a cancer
OL,15,Fdiagnosis.
OL,17,F"Creating this calendar has been an
OL,18,Fextraordinary journey in so many ways,"
OL,19,Fsaid Jenny Thomas, from Cutnall Green,
OL,20,Fwho runs the group.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
